<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak Jan-May budget deficit widens to SKK 7.2bln.</title>
<headline>Slovak Jan-May budget deficit widens to SKK 7.2bln.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Slovak state budget posted a deficit of 7.177 billion crowns for the January-May period of 1997, up from a 3.418 billion shortfall for the same period in 1996, the Finance Ministry said on Friday.</p>
<p>The budget showed a deficit of 4.692 billion crowns for the first four months of 1997.</p>
</text>
